==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sla-pro|ru}} {{term/t|sla-pro|*narodъ}}, from {{prefix|sc=Cyrl|на|род|lang=ru}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/nɐˈrot/|lang=ru}}
* {{audio|Ru-народ.ogg|audio}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun|наро́д|m}}

# [[people]]
# [[nation]]

====Declension====
{{ru-noun-1|наро́д}}

*<nowiki>*</nowiki> ''When the meaning is "people" ({{lang|ru|[[люди]]}}), the genitive singular may be either'' {{lang|ru|наро́да}} ''or'' {{lang|ru|наро́ду}}.
*<nowiki>*</nowiki> ''Note that, although the word is animate, the accusative singular doesn't append [[а]] letter, thus the word behaves as if it were inanimate word.

===See also===
* {{l|ru|люди|sc=Cyrl}}
* {{l|ru|народный|sc=Cyrl}}

